Package: automation-toolbox
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Automation Toolbox Team <noreply@localhost>
Depends: python3-gi, libgtk-3-0t64, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Description: Local automation toolbox with optional model components
 A desktop toolbox with a separated FastAPI backend and React frontend.
 It includes media and dataset utilities, parallel execution, progress
 visualization, pause, retry, cancellation, and optional model providers.
